WEBVTT

00:06:57.446 --> 00:07:00.116
partly because of the technology, right?

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:03.027
AG: Think about how much time
you've wasted on tech problems.

00:07:03.051 --> 00:07:06.031
(Video call login sound)
First man: Hey, Paul. Can you hear me?

00:07:06.055 --> 00:07:08.173
(Login sound) Paul: Hey, guys. Hey, Tyler.

00:07:08.197 --> 00:07:10.695
Tyler: Sorry I'm late.
Having a hard time connecting.

00:07:10.719 --> 00:07:12.780
FM: One second. Paul's having
a sound issue.

00:07:12.804 --> 00:07:15.588
P: I can't hear you.
T: Try adjusting your output settings.

00:07:15.612 --> 00:07:17.623
P: Can you hear me?
T: It's the gear icon.

00:07:17.647 --> 00:07:20.508
P: Never mind. I got it.
I just had to change a few settings.

00:07:20.532 --> 00:07:24.153
FM: Great. Great. I think we can get
started then (Echoes) started then then.

00:07:24.177 --> 00:07:25.851
(Exasperated) Oh, great. Oh, great.

00:07:25.875 --> 00:07:27.545
AG: Another obvious issue is power.

00:07:27.569 --> 00:07:31.257
MH: And it's very easy to fall into
a very hierarchical form of communication.